WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.380
This is your workspace.

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:05.820
On the left is the outline of the whole course.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.971
In the middle is the part you are working on.

00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:12.509
Add a module with Add module.

00:00:12.459 --> 00:00:18.826
Each module has a menu for adding lessons, quizzes, assignments and discussions.

00:00:19.781 --> 00:00:28.871
To reorder, drag anything in the outline by its handle: lessons within a module, into another module, or whole modules.

00:00:29.776 --> 00:00:34.817
Choose Preview to see the lesson as learners will, on a laptop or a phone.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.006
It changes as you type.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:43.558
Your work saves itself a moment after you stop typing; the top bar says when.

00:00:43.508 --> 00:00:46.255
Control S saves straight away.

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:51.216
History lists earlier versions, and any of them can be restored.
